  "onbDepthTitle": "Each question in\nUPSC Wars has:",
  "aboutWhyBody": "I prepared for UPSC myself and realised that most aspirants solve thousands of MCQs but still don’t know where they are actually losing marks.\n\nSometimes the problem is not lack of knowledge — it is overconfidence, risky guessing, weak revision, and repeated mistakes.\n\nAt the same time, preparation is also about knowing where you can safely take smart risks and attempt more with confidence.\n\nThat is why I built UPSC Wars.",
  "aboutGoalBody": "So your preparation becomes smarter, not just harder.\n\nMy goal is simple:\n\nHelp aspirants prepare like someone who clears Prelims.\n\nBuilt independently. No coaching institute. No big team. Just a serious attempt to make UPSC preparation better.",
  "aboutConnectBody": "Your feedback directly improves UPSC Wars.\n\nIf something feels missing, confusing, or useful, please message me. I read every feedback personally.\n\n📩 upscwars@gmail.com",
